# The on-device model sometimes answers with the prompt's page block copied back ("<url>…</title>
# <current-date>…<content>…"): Wikipedia's Bauhaus page, cut to 18 %, 1 run in 10 and 2 of 2 in the
# 0.1.43 release clips. The card never shows it; Cra asks again and shows that answer. The test
# model echoes once when asked to "repeat the page".
pace 0.5
env CRA_TIDY_FAKE_MODEL=1
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "askOnPage": true}

cra://open?url=${ORIGIN}/ask.html
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://action/find
cra://debug?ask=Please repeat the page, then tell me about StandBy.
wait 4
expect-log Ask on Page: the answer repeated the page; asking again
cra://debug?askOnPage=echo
expect-log ask echo: enabled=true canAsk=true messages=1 finished=true quotes=1
